  "diagramType": "use_case",
  "difficulty": "Advanced",
  "domain": "Healthcare",
  "statement": "A telehealth platform serves Patients and Doctors, both of whom are specialized User actors who must Log In. A Patient can Book Consultation (which always includes Verify Insurance via an external Insurance API). Both Patient and Doctor participate in Conduct Video Visit. During a visit, a Doctor may optionally Issue E-Prescription, which must be transmitted to an external Pharmacy Network.",
  "deliverables": [
    "Model actor generalization (Patient and Doctor inheriting from User).",
    "Capture login, booking, insurance verification, video visit, and optional e-prescribing.",
    "Include external system actors (Insurance API, Pharmacy Network)."
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Use Generalization arrows from Patient -> User and Doctor -> User so both inherit Log In.",
    "Book Consultation «include»s Verify Insurance (linked to Insurance API).",
    "Issue E-Prescription «extend»s Conduct Video Visit and associates with Pharmacy Network."
  ],
